"end": 31.27,
"text": "And Tax Gull take a piece of every gallon."
},
{
"start": 31.33,
"end": 33.85,
"text": "In real life, this car get 13 miles per gallon."
},
{
"start": 33.89,
"end": 36.87,
"text": "Electric car go about 4 miles on 1 kWh."
},
{
"start": 36.93,
"end": 38.8,
"text": "White car cost $40,000."
},
{
"start": 38.84,
"end": 40.56,
"text": "Red car cost $400,000."
},
{
"start": 40.62,
"end": 41.58,
"text": "Doug pick white car."
